{"kp_id": "zj-004.kp0001", "video_id": "zj-004", "type": "clinical_tip", "statement": "留针通常20–30分钟；中风可留40–60分钟甚至更久。", "entity_ids": ["method.zhen_jiu"], "chapter_id": "zj-004.c01", "evidence_quote": "这上面要留二十分钟", "seg_from": 19, "seg_to": 21, "start_s": 91.64, "end_s": 119.07, "citation": {"youtube_id": "fShKSE-oYZ4", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fShKSE-oYZ4&t=91s", "series": "zj", "episode": 4, "title": "Ni Hai-hsia \"Human Records\" \"Acupuncture\" Complete 90 Episodes - Acupuncture 04", "start_s": 91.64, "end_s": 119.07}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-004.kp0002", "video_id": "zj-004", "type": "clinical_tip", "statement": "出针垂直缓慢，近皮毛孔停三四秒，可减少出血。", "entity_ids": ["method.zhen_jiu"], "chapter_id": "zj-004.c01", "evidence_quote": "除了皮肤毛孔的啃的时候停一下", "seg_from": 26, "seg_to": 27, "start_s": 136.63, "end_s": 157.215, "citation": {"youtube_id": "fShKSE-oYZ4", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fShKSE-oYZ4&t=136s", "series": "zj", "episode": 4, "title": "Ni Hai-hsia \"Human Records\" \"Acupuncture\" Complete 90 Episodes - Acupuncture 04", "start_s": 136.63, "end_s": 157.22}, "confidence": 0.85, "asr_note": "啃≈处", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-004.kp0003", "video_id": "zj-004", "type": "contraindication", "statement": "十四岁以下儿童宜单刺（针入即出），不留针。", "entity_ids": ["new.method.单刺"], "chapter_id": "zj-004.c01", "evidence_quote": "十四岁十四岁以下全部采单词不留针", "seg_from": 42, "seg_to": 44, "start_s": 218.2, "end_s": 237.9, "citation": {"youtube_id": "fShKSE-oYZ4", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fShKSE-oYZ4&t=218s", "series": "zj", "episode": 4, "title": "Ni Hai-hsia \"Human Records\" \"Acupuncture\" Complete 90 Episodes - Acupuncture 04", "start_s": 218.2, "end_s": 237.9}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "单词=单刺", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-004.kp0004", "video_id": "zj-004", "type": "contraindication", "statement": "尽量卧位施针；站立、久坐易晕针。晕针则平卧松衣通风，可刺人中，勿过度折腾。", "entity_ids": ["new.concept.晕针", "acupoint.gv26"], "chapter_id": "zj-004.c01", "evidence_quote": "我们就针灸呢下身以后常常会有一种现象，我们称为晕针", "seg_from": 48, "seg_to": 68, "start_s": 253.12, "end_s": 386.135, "citation": {"youtube_id": "fShKSE-oYZ4", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fShKSE-oYZ4&t=253s", "series": "zj", "episode": 4, "title": "Ni Hai-hsia \"Human Records\" \"Acupuncture\" Complete 90 Episodes - Acupuncture 04", "start_s": 253.12, "end_s": 386.13}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-004.kp0005", "video_id": "zj-004", "type": "clinical_tip", "statement": "常用32号×1.5寸毫针；手足用1寸；硬结肿胀改28号。三寸针可做透刺。", "entity_ids": ["method.zhen_jiu", "new.method.透穴"], "chapter_id": "zj-004.c02", "evidence_quote": "这是我们用的最多的一寸半", "seg_from": 91, "seg_to": 97, "start_s": 509.52, "end_s": 557.51, "citation": {"youtube_id": "fShKSE-oYZ4", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fShKSE-oYZ4&t=509s", "series": "zj", "episode": 4, "title": "Ni Hai-hsia \"Human Records\" \"Acupuncture\" Complete 90 Episodes - Acupuncture 04", "start_s": 509.52, "end_s": 557.51}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-004.kp0006", "video_id": "zj-004", "type": "concept_definition", "statement": "天干配脏腑取五行：甲胆乙肝为木，丙小肠丁心为火等；脏为阴、腑为阳。", "entity_ids": ["concept.wu_xing", "concept.yin_yang"], "chapter_id": "zj-004.c03", "evidence_quote": "甲胆乙肝丙小肠，丙小肠丁心无味己脾", "seg_from": 167, "seg_to": 216, "start_s": 973.18, "end_s": 1304.539, "citation": {"youtube_id": "fShKSE-oYZ4", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fShKSE-oYZ4&t=973s", "series": "zj", "episode": 4, "title": "Ni Hai-hsia \"Human Records\" \"Acupuncture\" Complete 90 Episodes - Acupuncture 04", "start_s": 973.18, "end_s": 1304.54}, "confidence": 0.85, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
